    {
      "id": 1,
      "file": "src/voice/01.mp3",
      "text": "[weary] There was an orchard here once.",
      "takes": 1,
      "bytes": 18434,
      "durationMs": 2240,
      "slotMs": 3200
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "file": "src/voice/02.mp3",
      "text": "[wistful] Rows and rows of trees, every one of them heavy with apples.",
      "takes": 1,
      "bytes": 40795,
      "durationMs": 5040,
      "slotMs": 5600
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "file": "src/voice/03.mp3",
      "text": "[proud] I was its warden. I knew every tree by name.",
      "takes": 1,
      "bytes": 29928,
      "durationMs": 3680,
      "slotMs": 4800
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "file": "src/voice/04.mp3",
      "text": "[bitter] Then they came. They took the apples. All of them.",
      "takes": 1,
      "bytes": 33271,
      "durationMs": 4080,
      "slotMs": 4800
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "file": "src/voice/05.mp3",
      "text": "[grim] They took the trees. They took the fence.",
      "takes": 1,
      "bytes": 23658,
      "durationMs": 2880,
      "slotMs": 4000
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "file": "src/voice/06.mp3",
      "text": "[deadpan] They even took the little sign that said Orchard.",
      "takes": 1,
      "bytes": 23031,
      "durationMs": 2800,
      "slotMs": 4400
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "file": "src/voice/07.mp3",
      "text": "[hollow] Now there is only this field. And it is very dark.",
      "takes": 1,
      "bytes": 40795,
      "durationMs": 5040,
      "slotMs": 5200
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "file": "src/voice/08.mp3",
      "text": "[hopeful] But somewhere out there, there is one apple left.",
      "takes": 1,
      "bytes": 32017,
      "durationMs": 3920,
      "slotMs": 4400
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "file": "src/voice/09.mp3",
      "text": "[resolute] I am retired. I am three squares long. I am going to get it.",
      "takes": 1,
      "bytes": 41421,
      "durationMs": 5120,
      "slotMs": 6400
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "file": "src/voice/10.mp3",
      "text": "[quiet] One apple. Not the orchard. But it is a start.",
      "takes": 1,
      "bytes": 31181,
      "durationMs": 3840,
      "slotMs": 4800
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "file": "src/voice/11.mp3",
      "text": "[nostalgic] It tastes like the old days. Crisp. A little sour.",
      "takes": 1,
      "bytes": 32644,
      "durationMs": 4000,
      "slotMs": 4800
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "file": "src/voice/12.mp3",
      "text": "[rueful] I used to count them. Now I just eat them.",
      "takes": 1,
      "bytes": 28047,
      "durationMs": 3440,
      "slotMs": 4800
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "file": "src/voice/13.mp3",
      "text": "[defiant] They can take the trees. They cannot take the taste.",
      "takes": 1,
      "bytes": 29301,
      "durationMs": 3600,
      "slotMs": 4800
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "file": "src/voice/14.mp3",
