      {
        "id": "v1.1-1",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.1-1.mp3",
        "text": "I'm turning Snake into a AAA game. Patch 1.1.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:04:53.368Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 30554,
        "durationMs": 3760
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.1-2",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.1-2.mp3",
        "text": "A real game doesn't just start. It has a publisher, a studio and an engine, and you see all three first.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:04:55.428Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 55004,
        "durationMs": 6800
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.1-3",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.1-3.mp3",
        "text": "Three logos and a warning you can't skip. First apple moves from zero point three seconds to nineteen.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:04:57.424Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 52496,
        "durationMs": 6480
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.1-4",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.1-4.mp3",
        "text": "Next patch: a day-one patch. Subscribe so you don't miss it, like it if you've ever skipped a logo, and tell me in the comments what else a real launch needs.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:04:59.383Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 67125,
        "durationMs": 8320
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.2-1",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.2-1.mp3",
        "text": "I'm turning Snake into a AAA game. Patch 1.2.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:01.813Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 30554,
        "durationMs": 3760
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.2-2",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.2-2.mp3",
        "text": "Big games ship, then patch themselves on day one. So Snake now updates before it runs.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:02.906Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 49780,
        "durationMs": 6160
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.2-3",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.2-3.mp3",
        "text": "The patch is two thousand bytes. Downloading it costs four and a half thousand. The headers are bigger than the fix.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:04.581Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 53750,
        "durationMs": 6640
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.2-4",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.2-4.mp3",
        "text": "Next patch: a story. Subscribe for it, like it if you've waited for a patch on launch night, and comment what the snake's backstory should be.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:06.650Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 65871,
        "durationMs": 8160
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.3-1",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.3-1.mp3",
        "text": "I'm turning Snake into a AAA game. Patch 1.3.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:08.771Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 29927,
        "durationMs": 3680
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.3-2",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.3-2.mp3",
        "text": "Every AAA hero has a voice, a past and a wound. Meet Warden Snek. He had an orchard. They took it.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T20:09:59.523Z",
        "takes": 3,
        "bytes": 69006,
        "durationMs": 8560,
        "history": [
          {
