      {
        "id": "v1.3-3",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.3-3.mp3",
        "text": "The opening is forty-four seconds. You control the snake eight percent of the time. The rest is cinema.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:12.187Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 51034,
        "durationMs": 6320
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.3-4",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.3-4.mp3",
        "text": "Next patch: online. Yes, for a single-player snake. Subscribe, like it if you skip cutscenes, and comment which feature is still missing.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:13.987Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 74230,
        "durationMs": 9200
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.4-1",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.4-1.mp3",
        "text": "I'm turning Snake into a AAA game. Patch 1.4.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:16.367Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 30554,
        "durationMs": 3760
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.4-2",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.4-2.mp3",
        "text": "Every big release is online now, even the single-player ones. So Snake has a login, a queue and terms of service.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:17.719Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 59393,
        "durationMs": 7360
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.4-3",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.4-3.mp3",
        "text": "There's no one else on the server. You still wait seven seconds. Industry standard.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:19.762Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 42883,
        "durationMs": 5280
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.4-4",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.4-4.mp3",
        "text": "Next patch: an open world. Subscribe for it, like it if you've been in a queue for a single-player game, and comment how big the world should be.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:21.506Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 65871,
        "durationMs": 8160
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.5-1",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.5-1.mp3",
        "text": "I'm turning Snake into a AAA game. Patch 1.5.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:23.759Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 34524,
        "durationMs": 4240
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.5-2",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.5-2.mp3",
        "text": "A twenty-by-twenty field is not content. So the field is now two hundred fifty-six by two hundred fifty-six, with six hundred map markers.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:25.039Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 76111,
        "durationMs": 9440
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.5-3",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.5-3.mp3",
        "text": "One hundred sixty chests. All empty. One apple. Fast travel is coming in a future update.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:27.294Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 59393,
        "durationMs": 7360
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.5-4",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.5-4.mp3",
        "text": "Next patch: a skill tree. Subscribe, like it if you've opened an empty chest, and comment which skill the snake should unlock first.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:29.208Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 60647,
        "durationMs": 7520
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.6-1",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.6-1.mp3",
        "text": "I'm turning Snake into a AAA game. Patch 1.6.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:31.789Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 32016,
        "durationMs": 3920
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.6-2",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.6-2.mp3",
        "text": "AAA games don't give you abilities. You unlock them. So turning is now a skill tree.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:33.206Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 42883,
        "durationMs": 5280
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.6-3",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.6-3.mp3",
        "text": "Left turn: level five. Before that, you earn it. That's called progression.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:35.070Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 42256,
        "durationMs": 5200
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.6-4",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.6-4.mp3",
        "text": "Next patch: a battle pass. You knew it was coming. Subscribe, like it if you've grinded for a basic move, and comment what goes in the loot boxes.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:36.556Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 73603,
        "durationMs": 9120
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.7-1",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.7-1.mp3",
        "text": "I'm turning Snake into a AAA game. Patch 1.7. Season One.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:38.885Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 46645,
        "durationMs": 5760
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.7-2",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.7-2.mp3",
        "text": "A game needs a season, a pass and loot boxes. Cosmetics only, of course. Ten skins. The legendary one is the snake you started with.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:40.580Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 74857,
        "durationMs": 9280
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.7-3",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.7-3.mp3",
        "text": "The apple is now hidden. The top reward of the pass is the ability to see it. First apple: eighteen minutes.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:43.318Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 57512,
        "durationMs": 7120
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.7-4",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.7-4.mp3",
        "text": "Next patch: the remaster. The game is two days old. Subscribe, like it if you've bought a skin, and comment: one patch is yours, what should it add?",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:45.399Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 79873,
        "durationMs": 9920
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.9-1",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.9-1.mp3",
        "text": "I'm turning Snake into a AAA game. Patch 1.9. Remastered.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:48.045Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 42256,
        "durationMs": 5200
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.9-2",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.9-2.mp3",
        "text": "Every classic gets a remaster. Bloom, grain, chromatic aberration, and hair physics on a twenty-by-twenty grid.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:49.609Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 61900,
        "durationMs": 7680
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.9-3",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.9-3.mp3",
        "text": "Four graphics presets. All of them are Ultra. The apple is in the same place.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:51.710Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 49153,
        "durationMs": 6080
      },
      {
        "id": "v1.9-4",
        "file": "voice/host/v1.9-4.mp3",
        "text": "Next patch: the Game of the Year Edition. We haven't won anything. Subscribe for the finale, like it if you've bought a remaster of a game you own, and comment your patch: it's still open.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:53.341Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 90113,
        "durationMs": 11200
      },
      {
        "id": "v2.0-1",
        "file": "voice/host/v2.0-1.mp3",
        "text": "I'm turning Snake into a AAA game. Patch 2.0. The final one.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:56.389Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 46018,
        "durationMs": 5680
      },
      {
        "id": "v2.0-2",
        "file": "voice/host/v2.0-2.mp3",
        "text": "Every big game ends with a nostalgia piece: a little arcade cabinet with the original inside. So I put Snake 1.0 in Snake.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:05:57.899Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 67125,
        "durationMs": 8320
      },
      {
        "id": "v2.0-3",
        "file": "voice/host/v2.0-3.mp3",
        "text": "Walk six steps, press Enter, and you're playing the real thing. First apple: one hundred and seven seconds. You control the snake for less than one of them.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:06:00.257Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 84470,
        "durationMs": 10480
      },
      {
        "id": "v2.0-4",
        "file": "voice/host/v2.0-4.mp3",
        "text": "That's the whole game. Play any version: the link is in the description. Subscribe for the full video, like it if you'd play the cabinet, and comment the one patch you want: I'll build it.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:06:02.774Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 83843,
        "durationMs": 10400
      },
      {
        "id": "trailer-1",
        "file": "voice/host/trailer-1.mp3",
        "text": "This is Snake. This is Snake after I made it AAA.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:06:05.687Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 29300,
        "durationMs": 3600
      },
      {
        "id": "trailer-2",
        "file": "voice/host/trailer-2.mp3",
        "text": "Done.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:06:06.850Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 5058,
        "durationMs": 560
      },
      {
        "id": "trailer-3",
        "file": "voice/host/trailer-3.mp3",
        "text": "Logos, a day-one patch, a story, a login, an open world, a skill tree, a season, a remaster.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:06:07.577Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 70260,
        "durationMs": 8720
      },
      {
        "id": "trailer-4",
        "file": "voice/host/trailer-4.mp3",
        "text": "The only way to eat the apple is the arcade cabinet with the old game inside.",
        "requestedAt": "2026-10-15T19:06:09.762Z",
        "takes": 1,
        "bytes": 32016,
        "durationMs": 3920
      },
